# Données d'exemple pour création de Needs (User Needs)

Ce fichier fournit, pour chaque `NeedType`, :
- le payload `POST /public/needs` (création)
- la réponse attendue (schéma retourné par l'API : `savedNeed` + `matchingProducts`)

Important : `user_id` est la chaîne "1" dans tous les exemples.
Les horodatages utilisent le format UTC/Z (`yyyy-MM-dd'T'HH:mm:ss.SSSZ`).

---

1) NEED ELECTRONIC

Request (payload):
{
  "name": "Recherche iPhone reconditionné",
  "max_price": 200000,
  "quantity": 1,
  "currency": "XAF",
  "type": "ELECTRONIC",
  "description": "Cherche iPhone en bon état",
  "user_id": "1",
  "photo_urls": [],
  "mandatory_fields": ["brand", "model"],
  "electronic_type": "PHONE",
  "brand": "Apple",
  "model": "iPhone 11",
  "specifications": "{ \"min_ram\": \"4GB\" }",
  "warranty_period": "6"
}

Expected response (201 Created):
{
  "savedNeed": {
    "name": "Recherche iPhone reconditionné",
    "max_price": 200000,
    "quantity": 1,
    "currency": "XAF",
    "type": "ELECTRONIC",
    "description": "Cherche iPhone en bon état",
    "user_id": "1",
    "photo_urls": [],
    "mandatory_fields": ["brand", "model"],
    "electronic_type": "PHONE",
    "brand": "Apple",
    "model": "iPhone 11",
    "specifications": "{ \"min_ram\": \"4GB\" }",
    "warranty_period": "6"
  },
  "matchingProducts": []
}

